comments[9]:
  - created_at: "2026-08-01T20:20:19.401Z"
    author: "harness:codex"
    text: "Duplicate-check evidence: all-status searches found closed pm-mp49 as the exact historical owner plus closed core sentinel work pm-i02t; no active recurrence exists. Live 2026-08-01 reproduction: explicit --status all fails while omission considers all 2,263 items. --allow-duplicate is used only to represent this versioned regression without rewriting or reopening the immutable completion record."
  - created_at: "2026-08-01T20:21:53.634Z"
    author: "harness:codex"
    text: "Planning note: fix ownership belongs in the shared lifecycle-filter parser and package action contract, not as another local special case. Verification must include source tests plus a freshly packed installed package because the historical item passed at that boundary and current source behavior regressed. The regression should also reply to the misleading recovery path by making allowed values include the all sentinel when the command supports it."
  - created_at: "2026-08-01T20:25:23.985Z"
    author: "harness:codex"
    text: "Organization evidence: this is the only active owner of the 2026.8.1 recurrence. Exact-title dedupe remains unchanged from the historical canceled probe cluster and parent-scope dedupe has zero clusters. pm-4flipp was consolidated into this item through pm dedupe-merge with duplicate_of metadata after delayed command output revealed the first create had succeeded."
  - created_at: "2026-09-05T16:54:19.516Z"
    author: "harness:codex"
    text: "Live 2026-09-05 GitHub census: no open PRs/issues or dependency/code/secret alerts at orientation. Complete package dedupe now consumes strict all-lifecycle SDK lists and immutable per-call status context. pnpm audit reports zero vulnerabilities; npm registry still confirms canonical deferrals pm-ksr40d (Node floor), pm-do5b (parser peer range), and pm-fokyhh (CodSpeed peer range). No duplicate dependency items created."
  - created_at: "2026-09-05T17:27:26.189Z"
    author: "harness:codex"
    text: "External closeout evidence before review: latest compatible ESLint 10.10.0 installed; pnpm audit zero findings across 435 dependencies; Trivy high/critical vulnerabilities/secrets/misconfigurations zero; ShellCheck passes; GitHub open PRs/issues/dependency/code/secret alerts zero before this delivery PR. All ten latest closed GitHub issues have PM-item link comments. Required Sentry/telemetry gate passes: zero blocking issues in 14 days, finish error rate 1.06%, zero missing-error-code failures."
    edited_at: "2026-09-05T17:29:27.645Z"
  - created_at: "2026-09-05T17:53:08.279Z"
    author: "harness:codex"
    text: "Final local evidence: 8457 tests across 617 files pass at exact 100% lines/statements/functions/branches (60094/62503/12956/47351 covered). Full quality:static passes, including unchanged token ceilings, docstrings, graph composition, and record integrity. Typecheck, version policy, ShellCheck, credential scan, zero-vulnerability dependency audit, and enforced Trivy scan pass. Final npm/npx and Bun/bunx packed smoke covers all 13 packages; separate temporary installed SDK/CLI acceptance passes. Required Sentry/telemetry gate passes with zero blocking Sentry groups and no failures lacking error codes. PR review and hosted checks are the remaining delivery stage."
  - created_at: "2026-09-05T18:16:31.124Z"
    author: "harness:codex"
    text: "Review documentation follow-through: add explicit purpose and invariant docstrings to private functions touched by this delivery. Mandatory module/public/member documentation gates already pass; the reviewer uses a broader touched-function denominator. No runtime behavior or quality threshold changes."
  - created_at: "2026-09-05T18:18:56.282Z"
    author: "harness:codex"
    text: "PR #1204 documentation follow-through: moved 20 existing body-local API-purpose comments to declaration JSDoc positions so review tools recognize the same substantive documentation. No dedupe behavior, filtering, ordering, or public data shape changed."
  - created_at: "2026-09-05T18:34:27.253Z"
    author: "harness:codex"
    text: "PR #1204 round-one dispositions recorded on every original review/comment surface with up/down reactions. Three documentation/test findings fixed; two unsupported findings answered with source and tracker evidence. Regex heading stripping removed after CodeQL alert 38; hosted revalidation remains pending on the next head. Final local proof: 8458 tests in 617 files, exact coverage 60107/60107 lines, 62520/62520 statements, 12957/12957 functions, 47365/47365 branches. All 68 touched named non-test functions have declaration JSDoc. Full static/type/documentation gates, all five PM-linked runs, final npm/npx+Bun/bunx 13-package smoke, separate temporary packed acceptance, dependency audit, and immutable tracked-tree Trivy scan pass. Sourcery substantive review is unavailable under its current quota; Greptile has not responded. These are availability limitations, not approval."
learnings[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-09-05T17:24:21.666Z","harness:codex",Resolve custom workflow semantics per invocation and carry terminal classification with prepared candidates. Concurrent package calls must never consult mutable process-wide status registries; a real two-workspace regression proves opposite roles for the same status remain isolated.
